# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored and the protect-secrets hook
# keeps Claude out of it — edit it yourself.
#
# Claude Code does not read .env. Export the token into the shell you start
# `claude` from, so ${GITHUB_PAT} in .mcp.json expands (Session 04):
#   set -a; source .env; set +a; claude
#
# Fine-grained token: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
GITHUB_PAT=
